    "title": "NYC Ferry",
    "description": "Commuting made comfortable with NYC Ferry. Come see just how easy (and enjoyable) your journey can be.\r\n\u00a0\r\nHere are 5 great things you can expect from the NYC Ferry app:\r\n* \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Help NYC \u201cgo green\u201d with paperless ticketing! Buy and use tickets directly from your phone.\r\n* \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Take the stress out of your commute with live scheduling and real-time updates.\r\n* \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Get ready for an adventure! Explore NYC with our end-to-end trip planner.\r\n* \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Stay ahead of the game with push notifications for the routes that matter to YOU.\r\n* \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Love to ride? Take advantage of our 30-day Unlimited Pass! Available in-app only.\r\n\u00a0\r\nNYC Ferry (operated by Hornblower) proudly serves New Yorkers in Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens and The Bronx along the East River. Our state-of-the-art vessels offer you a better commuting experience\u2014all for the same price as a subway ride!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Commuting made comfortable with NYC Ferry. Come see just how easy (and enjoyable) your journey can be.<br>\u00a0<br>Here are 5 great things you can expect from the NYC Ferry app:<br>* \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Help NYC \u201cgo green\u201d with paperless ticketing! Buy and use tickets directly from your phone.<br>* \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Take the stress out of your commute with live scheduling and real-time updates.<br>* \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Get ready for an adventure! Explore NYC with our end-to-end trip planner.<br>* \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Stay ahead of the game with push notifications for the routes that matter to YOU.<br>* \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Love to ride? Take advantage of our 30-day Unlimited Pass! Available in-app only.<br>\u00a0<br>NYC Ferry (operated by Hornblower) proudly serves New Yorkers in Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens and The Bronx along the East River. Our state-of-the-art vessels offer you a better commuting experience\u2014all for the same price as a subway ride!",
